sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant H as Human
  participant L as Listener
  participant W as Worker
  participant R as Router
  participant B as Librarian
  participant P as Planner
  participant E as Executor
  participant A as Analyst (A2A)
  participant V as Reviewer
  participant S as Scribe

  H->>L: app_mention
  L-->>H: 200 OK (~40ms)
  L->>W: enqueue run
  W->>R: classify
  R->>B: route: incident question
  B->>B: thread + memory, scoped by channel binding
  B->>P: context bundle
  par tools
    P->>E: query Grafana, list incidents
    E-->>P: metrics + oncall
  and specialist
    P->>A: task: correlate with last 30d postmortems
    A-->>P: findings + citations
  end
  P->>V: draft answer
  V--xP: unsupported claim, revise
  P->>V: revised draft
  V-->>W: approved
  W-->>H: reply in thread
  W->>S: run transcript
  S->>S: dedupe, then write 2 memories
